 ": a mathematically explicit toroidal geometry module for the smallest \
candidate scale. It focuses on: "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2fdd4fc5-8c15-b24e-b303-f2ab3d5e8264"],

Cell["symbolic torus parameterization,", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"3c0abf85-03b0-3442-ae74-34eeee876daa"],

